OL,3,GNEWSASpitting Image co-creator Peter
OL,4,AFluck dies aged 85
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Fluck, co-creator of
OL,7,Faward-winning satirical puppet show
OL,8,FSpitting Image, has died aged 85.
OL,10,FHis family said he died in the early
OL,11,Fhours of Saturday at home in Cornwall,
OL,12,Ffollowing a recent illness.
OL,14,FSpitting Image was immensely popular
OL,15,Fand sometimes controversial, running
OL,16,Ffrom 1984-1996 across 18 seasons, and
OL,17,Ffeatured puppet caricatures of
OL,18,Fcelebrities, politicians and royals,
OL,19,Fincluding former Prime Minister
OL,20,FMargaret Thatcher and Queen Elizabeth
OL,21,Fthe Queen Mother.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
